  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "안심할 수 있는 맛, 분위기, 가격.\n어서 오세요, 보통 레스토랑입니다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C548C2ECD5600020C2180020C788B2940020B9DB002C0020BD84C704AE30002C0020AC00ACA9002E000AC5B4C11C0020C624C138C694002C0020BCF4D1B50020B808C2A4D1A0B791C785B2C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "한결같이 위를 향하는 것! 이것이야말로\n저의 영혼에 새겨진 삶의 태도랍니다.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D55CACB0AC19C7740020C704B97C0020D5A5D558B2940020AC8300210020C774AC83C774C57CB9D0B85C000AC800C7580020C601D63CC5D00020C0C8ACA8C9C40020C0B6C7580020D0DCB3C4B78DB2C8B2E4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "풀코스에\n도전해 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>봊\nText_icon1",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D480CF54C2A4C5D0000AB3C4C804D5740020C8FCC138C694002100100002BD0A000A0054006500780074005F00690063006F006E00310000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나를 칭찬해 주는 건\n나밖에 없단 말이지...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B97C0020CE6DCC2CD5740020C8FCB2940020AC74000AB098BC16C5D00020C5C6B2E80020B9D0C774C9C0002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "네 포켓몬도 분명\n너를 칭찬하고 있을 거야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B1240020D3ECCF13BAACB3C40020BD84BA85000AB108B97C0020CE6DCC2CD558ACE00020C788C7440020AC70C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단 하나의 데세르에\n미각을 집중!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E80020D558B098C7580020B370C138B974C5D0000ABBF8AC01C7440020C9D1C91100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "여기서 파는 크레페 수제트...\n보통처럼 보여도 맛은 최고야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5ECAE30C11C0020D30CB2940020D06CB808D3980020C218C81CD2B8002E002E002E000ABCF4D1B5CC98B7FC0020BCF4C5ECB3C40020B9DBC7400020CD5CACE0C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부를 보면서\n식사를 하다니, 좋은걸?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80B97C0020BCF4BA74C11C000AC2DDC0ACB97C0020D558B2E4B2C8002C0020C88BC740AC78003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "씁쓸한 승부를 보면\n요리까지 씁쓸해지는 기분이야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C501C4F8D55C0020C2B9BD80B97C0020BCF4BA74000AC694B9ACAE4CC9C00020C501C4F8D574C9C0B2940020AE30BD84C774C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "포켓몬 승부가 시작되면\n애들이 밥을 안 먹는단 말이지",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3ECCF13BAAC0020C2B9BD80AC000020C2DCC791B418BA74000AC560B4E4C7740020BC25C7440020C5480020BA39B294B2E80020B9D0C774C9C00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지고 있는 쪽 포켓몬에게\n자뭉열매를 주고 싶어져!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0ACE00020C788B2940020CABD0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D0AC8C000AC790BB49C5F4B9E4B97C0020C8FCACE00020C2F6C5B4C83800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그러시군요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7ECC2DCAD70C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 가게 요리가 없으면\n난 너무 슬퍼서 울고 말 거야!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020AC00AC8C0020C694B9ACAC000020C5C6C73CBA74000AB09C0020B108BB340020C2ACD37CC11C0020C6B8ACE00020B9D00020AC70C57C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "난 조용히\n식사를 즐기고 싶어.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B09C0020C870C6A9D788000AC2DDC0ACB97C0020C990AE30ACE00020C2F6C5B4002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 로제 씨의 요리야!\n갈수록 퀄리티가 높아진다니까.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020B85CC81C0020C528C7580020C694B9ACC57C0021000AAC08C218B85D0020D004B9ACD2F0AC000020B192C544C9C4B2E4B2C8AE4C002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "죄송해요.\n요리사라고는 즈미 씨밖에 모르거든요.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C8C4C1A1D574C694002E000AC694B9ACC0ACB77CACE0B2940020C988BBF80020C528BC16C5D00020BAA8B974AC70B4E0C694002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "결혼식과 은혼식\n전부 여기에서 했었죠?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACB0D63CC2DDACFC0020C740D63CC2DD000AC804BD800020C5ECAE30C5D0C11C0020D588C5C8C8E0003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "평온한 삶을\n살아왔다는 증거지요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1136,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D3C9C628D55C0020C0B6C744000AC0B4C544C654B2E4B2940020C99DAC70C9C0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "앙트레, 수프, 푸아송이\n이번 코스 메뉴야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1172,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C559D2B8B808002C0020C218D504002C0020D478C544C1A1C774000AC774BC880020CF54C2A40020BA54B274C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이 사람이\n여기 단골이었거든",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7740020C0ACB78CC774000AC5ECAE300020B2E8ACE8C774C5C8AC70B4E00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "너무 보통 수준이라\n오히려 감동이야...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B108BB340020BCF4D1B50020C218C900C774B77C000AC624D788B8240020AC10B3D9C774C57C002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "살짝 맛있는 요리만\n계속해서 나오다니 최고인걸",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C0B4C9DD0020B9DBC788B2940020C694B9ACB9CC000AACC4C18DD574C11C0020B098C624B2E4B2C80020CD5CACE0C778AC780000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "빨리 먹고 싶다!\n주방에 가서 달라고 할까!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BE68B9AC0020BA39ACE00020C2F6B2E40021000AC8FCBC29C5D00020AC00C11C0020B2ECB77CACE00020D560AE4C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "매너라는 건 남에게 빈틈을\n보이지 않기 위해 있는 거야",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B9E4B108B77CB2940020AC740020B0A8C5D0AC8C0020BE48D2C8C744000ABCF4C774C9C00020C54AAE300020C704D5740020C788B2940020AC70C57C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    }
